===Etymology 1===
{{ja-kanjitab|こうじ|yomi=k|alt=糀,糱}}
{{swp|ja:麹}}
{{swp|Aspergillus oryzae}}

Two likely derivations:
* Shift from a compound of {{compound|ja|sort=こうじ|黴|tr1=kabi|t1=[[mold]]||alt2=発ち|tr2=tachi|pos2={{ll|ja|連用形|stem or continuative form}} of verb {{m|ja|発つ|tr=tatsu}}, "to [[arise]]"}}.
*: {{IPAchar|/kabi tati/}} → {{IPAchar|/kaũtat͡ɕi/}} → {{IPAchar|/kaũdat͡ɕi/}} → {{IPAchar|/kaud͡ʑi/}} → {{IPAchar|/kɔːd͡ʑi/}} → {{IPAchar|/koːd͡ʑi/}}
* Alternatively, a shift from {{m|ja||醸し|tr=kamoshi}}, the {{m|ja|連用形|tr=ren'yōkei||stem or continuative form}} of verb {{m|ja|醸す|tr=kamosu||to [[brew]]}}.
*: {{IPAchar|/kamosi/}} → {{IPAchar|/kamuɕi/}} → {{IPAchar|/kaũɕi/}} → {{IPAchar|/kaũʑi/}} → {{IPAchar|/kɔːʑi/}} → {{IPAchar|/koːd͡ʑi/}}

